              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "MR-CARA-NPC01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Welcome back to Caravan, Wanderer. I hear dark tidings from the Sand Sea. Xerxes rallies his armies for war. We must be ready when he comes.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dromel_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Sandiago_MIR_30.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1379033,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "MR-CARA-NPC01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "What news from Aggrobah? They will join us in fighting the Overlord? This is a tremendous relief.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dromel_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Sandiago_MIR_31.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1379033,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "MR-CARA-NPC01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Ah, but the Sultana says this is not enough? Then she is indeed wiser than was the King of Thieves. I agree with her assessment.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dromel_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Sandiago_MIR_32.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1379033,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "MR-CARA-NPC01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Yes, of course. Do as the Sultana suggests. An alliance with the House Qhats will be our best chance to withstand the Overlord's onslaught.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dromel_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Sandiago_MIR_33.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1379033,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "MR-CARA-NPC01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "You will find the Agouti Rift south of here in the Caterwaul Canyons. The sands have settled and the way is clear. Winds be with you, Wanderer.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dromel_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Sandiago_MIR_34.mp3",
